Proj*<a1 s1>(Proj*<a0 s0>(Input<t0>))|Proj*<a2 s2>(Input<t1>)|AttrsSub(a0,t0);AttrsSub(a1,s0);TableEq(t1,t0);AttrsEq(a2,a1);SchemaEq(s2,s1)

