Filter<p0 a0>(Input<t0>)|Any<p1 a1>(Input<t1>,Input<t2>)|TableEq(t1,t0);PredicateAny(p0,p1,a1,t2)

# DIRECT(expression-rewrite): PredicateAll shares quantified comparison
