WindowRows<a0 o0 w0>(Input<t0>)|WindowRows<a1 o1 w1>(LeftApply<p0 a2 a3 a4>(Input<t1>,Input<t2>))|TableEq(t1,t0);AttrsEq(a1,a0);OrderEq(o1,o0);ExprListScalarSubquery(w0,w1,p0,a2,a3,a4,a5,t2)
