WindowRows<a0 o0 w0>(Input<t0>)|WindowRows<a1 o1 w1>(LeftApply<p0 a2 a3 a4>(Input<t1>,Limit<n0 n1>(Compute<e0 a5 s0>(Input<t2>))))|TableEq(t1,t0);AttrsEq(a1,a0);OrderEq(o1,o0);ExprListExists(w0,w1,e0,a5,s0,p0,a2,a3,a4,a6,t2);ScalarOne(n0);ScalarZero(n1)
