# 2026-09-02.
Compute<e0 a0 s0>(Input<t0>)|Compute<e1 a1 s1>(LeftApply<p0 a2 a3 a4>(Input<t1>,Limit<n0 n1>(Compute<e2 a5 s2>(Input<t2>))))|TableEq(t1,t0);SchemaEq(s1,s0);ExprListExists(e0,e1,e2,a5,s2,p0,a2,a3,a4,a6,t2);ScalarOne(n0);ScalarZero(n1)

# DIRECT(expression-rewrite): the opposite existential polarity shares the
# same explicit marker carrier; only the expression-list definition negates
# the false-on-empty result. FormalSQL/Rocq accepted this RuleIR on 2026-09-02.
Compute<e0 a0 s0>(Input<t0>)|Compute<e1 a1 s1>(LeftApply<p0 a2 a3 a4>(Input<t1>,Limit<n0 n1>(Compute<e2 a5 s2>(Input<t2>))))|TableEq(t1,t0);SchemaEq(s1,s0);ExprListNotExists(e0,e1,e2,a5,s2,p0,a2,a3,a4,a6,t2);ScalarOne(n0);ScalarZero(n1)

