Compute<e0 a0 s0>(Input<t0>)|Compute<e1 a1 s1>(LeftApply<p0 a2 a3 a4>(Input<t1>,Compute<e2 a5 s2>(Input<t2>)))|TableEq(t1,t0);SchemaEq(s1,s0);ExprListAll(e0,e1,e2,a5,s2,p0,a2,a3,a4,a6,t2)

