# DIRECT(expression-rewrite): ALL uses the same predicate-value carrier while
# retaining its NULL-aware quantified polarity.
# FormalSQL/Rocq accepted this RuleIR on 2026-09-02.
Filter<p0 a0>(Input<t0>)|Filter<p1 a1>(LeftApply<p2 a2 a3 a4>(Input<t1>,Compute<e0 a5 s0>(Input<t2>)))|TableEq(t1,t0);ExprListAll(p0,p1,e0,a5,s0,p2,a2,a3,a4,a6,t2)

