SemiJoin<p0 a0 a1>(Input<t0>,Input<t1>)|InnerJoin<p1 a2 a3>(Input<t2>,Limit<n0 n1>(Input<t3>))|TableEq(t2,t0);TableEq(t3,t1);PredicateEq(p1,p0);AttrsEq(a2,a0);AttrsEq(a3,a1);AttrsSub(a0,t0);AttrsEmpty(a1);Deterministic(p0);ScalarOne(n0);ScalarZero(n1);ErrorFree(p0);ErrorFree(p1)

# Replaces CXformLeftAntiSemiJoin2CrossProduct without its empty-input and
# nullable-predicate defects. For a predicate independent of the inner input,
# the two UNION ALL branches cover non-empty and empty inner relations;
