# When local correlation keys are not already grouped, construct the native
# aggregate compensation with AttrsUnion/SchemaUnion. CorrelationEquality,
# AttrsNonEmpty, scalar safety, and those constructors prove Filter movement,
# while PredicateDomainSplit independently
# routes the resulting current-join and enclosing-query conjuncts. This is the
# same generic operator-local contract used by the ordinary aggregate
# decorrelation rules, composed with the external expansion proof.
