InnerApply<p0 a0 a1 a2>(Input<t0>,Input<t1>)|Filter<p1 a3>(LeftApply<p2 a4 a5 a6>(Input<t2>,Input<t3>))|TableEq(t2,t0);TableEq(t3,t1);PredicateEq(p1,p0);PredicateEq(p2,p0);AttrsEq(a4,a0);AttrsEq(a5,a1);AttrsEq(a6,a2);AttrsUnion(a3,a4,a5);AttrsNonEmpty(a2);PredicateNullRejecting(p0,a1);ErrorFree(p0);Deterministic(p0)

Filter<p0 a0>(LeftJoin<p1 a1 a2>(Input<t0>,Input<t1>))|Filter<p2 a3>(InnerJoin<p3 a4 a5>(Input<t2>,Input<t3>))|TableEq(t2,t0);TableEq(t3,t1);PredicateEq(p2,p0);PredicateEq(p3,p1);AttrsEq(a3,a0);AttrsEq(a4,a1);AttrsEq(a5,a2);OutputAttrs(a6,t1);PredicateNullRejecting(p0,a6);ErrorFree(p0);Deterministic(p0)

